      "uid": "zhcn:3db25c149d8cbca5c2569fcd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然只是我的直觉啦。比起这个，\n现在还是重新洗牌比较重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "418077a0139db15a4eba129b4515983ca97961ffedb484c70b30fc3b93af3c2f",
